\section{Additional Transition and Analytical Investigations}
\label{sec:post-results-investigations}

The preceding sections define the deployed estimator and present its primary
comparative evidence.  The material below adds a bidirectional transition
diagnostic, a model-mismatch ablation, an IMU lever-arm installation study and
its self-calibrating variant, an engine-noise degradation study, and the
optional full-state physical-error formulation.  These investigations expose residual behavior and identify where
the reduced model is limited without revisiting superseded regularizer-law
comparisons.

